  "description": "<p>I attempted to create a new trader, but I failed miserably when making the filter loop for hideout items. Instead, I ended up with something interesting. It functions similarly, though not as intended.</p>\n<p>All the items are multiplied by: 1.5 from the handbook prices. This can be changed in the mod.ts (<em>Might add to config in future.</em>)<br />\n[src/mod.ts &gt; Find: “const fixedMultiplier = 1.5; and change the value”]<br />\nFeel free to make changes or additions. As mentioned earlier, I couldn’t get it to work as intended, but I ended up with something still useful.</p>\n<p>Ïts tested on 3.7.6 &amp; 3.7.4 (Standalone)</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.gyazo.com/c68050d272b7b3db6cf90d2549c58691.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/c68050d272b7b3db6cf90d2549c58691.jpg\" alt=\"c68050d272b7b3db6cf90d2549c58691.jpg\" /></a></p>\n",
